+| `npm run pack:mac:arm64` | Package macOS Apple Silicon installer (`.pkg`) |
+| `npm run pack:linux:x64` | Package Linux x64 Debian package (`.deb`) |
+| `npm run pack:linux:arm64` | Package Linux arm64 Debian package (`.deb`) |
